{"id":"083dcaa395f25a3d","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-todnf.md","title":"DNF representation of Boolean expressions","display":"thm-todnf — DNF representation of Boolean expressions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-todnf","aliases":["27-thm-todnf"],"display":"thm-todnf — DNF representation of Boolean expressions","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolexpr]]","[[27-df-dnf]]"],"local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-todnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-todnf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-todnf — DNF representation of Boolean expressions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{Eval}_n(\\varphi)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Existence is semantic; it does not claim that distributive expansion is output-polynomial in the expression size.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolexpr]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n$ and $\\mathrm{Eval}_n:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ (see [[27-df-boolexpr]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\